# Normalise line endings before this repo goes under version control.
#
# As of 2026-08-09 the working tree is mixed: 11 of 15 content files are CRLF
# and 4 are LF, because files were authored by different tools. Harmless to
# Astro, but it makes diffs on those files useless and they will flip wholesale
# the first time anyone's editor normalises them — producing a commit that looks
# like a total rewrite. Settle it now, before the first commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
